写实古风；主体：中年工匠；动作：工匠现身桌前，俯身看向托盘上的陶坯；镜头变化：从全景推近至工匠上半身；内容简述：工匠出现在桌前，俯身查看托盘上的陶坯；声音：窑火燃烧的轻微声响, [00:00:09-00:00:10] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：木夹、陶坯；动作：工匠手持木夹，从窑口夹出一块带纹样的陶坯；镜头变化：特写；内容简述：工匠用木夹从窑中取出一块陶坯；声音：窑火燃烧的轻微声响, [00:00:10-00:00:11] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：陶窑火焰；动作：窑内火焰剧烈燃烧；镜头变化：特写；内容简述：陶窑内的火焰正旺盛燃烧；声音：窑火燃烧的轻微声响, [00:00:11-00:00:15] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：中年工匠；动作：工匠转身看向身后的陶坯墙面；镜头变化：从工匠上半身拉远至全景；内容简述：工匠转身，看向身后满是规整陶坯的墙面；声音：窑火燃烧的轻微声响\\\"\\n}\",\"render_task_id\":\"58079841548\",\"cover_url\":\"https://p11-sign.douyinpic.com/everphoto-jianying-assets/oMYo1T1qbCAvXEQqn9FfABgIKuvpq6IjZeDsHK~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1794488978\\u0026l=202611122101565C2EF51700E52D34E518\\u0026x-expires=1810040993\\u0026x-signature=IsnoHGfqtoNAf%2FCizgVoQKbuaYk%3D\",\"music_meta\":null,\"preview_url\":\"https://v26-xyq-video.jianying.com/64f8e826934e50ea35a12916526d52aa/6be308a1/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/oYBdEA6og21sTAAWGxRulDEQiqavKiIL6ivE2/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=6278\\u0026bt=6278\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PN4sygkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=ajhpdXA5cjV1ZTczNDlmM0BpajhpdXA5cjV1ZTczNDlmM0BiaS41MmRraW5hLS1kNC9zYSNiaS41MmRraW5hLS1kNC9zcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80000e00010000\\u0026dy_q=1794488978\\u0026l=202611122101565C2EF51700E52D34E518\",\"render_task_status\":null,\"draft_key\":null,\"package_id\":null,\"vid\":null,\"render_rsp_map\":{\"disable_edit\":\"1\",\"watermark_version\":\"2\"},\"download_url\":\"https://v26-xyq-video.jianying.com/68d4551c0b62cf1748af28147c19b857/6be308a1/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/okFqoAWq9T8uAsLAEftbDZuBCv1fE9zAHGqgED/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=3565\\u0026bt=3565\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PN4sygkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=M2ZoZXk5cjV1ZTczNDlmM0BpM2ZoZXk5cjV1ZTczNDlmM0BpcWIwMmRzaW5hLS1kNC9zYSNpcWIwMmRzaW5hLS1kNC9zcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80000e00010000\\u0026dy_q=1794488978\\u0026l=202611122101565C2EF51700E52D34E51